   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_05"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I keep waking up at four and I can't fall back asleep. Any ideas?",
   "est_sec": 4.44,
   "gap_before": 0.5,
   "block": "sleep.dlg3",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "If you're awake for more than twenty minutes, get up and do something calm in dim light, like reading. Lying there stressed usually makes it worse.",
   "est_sec": 8.16,
   "gap_before": 0.95,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "sleep.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Should I look at the clock?",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 0.61,
   "block": "sleep.dlg3",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Better not. Turn it away from you, because counting the hours left tends to wake you up more.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 0.81,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "sleep.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I also have",
