   "text": "a glass of wine most evenings. Could that be it?",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 2.42,
   "block": "sleep.dlg3",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "It could. Alcohol helps you fall asleep but often wakes you up in the early morning hours. Try a week without it and see.",
   "est_sec": 7.54,
   "gap_before": 1.01,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "sleep.dlg3"
  },
  {
